{"ref":"BDB, קֶ֫רֶס","hw":"קֶ֫רֶס","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫רֶס</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>hook</strong>, on edge of curtains of tabern., matching the loops (<span dir=\"rtl\">לֻלָאֹת</span>, v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, לוּלַי\" href=\"/BDB,_לוּלַי\", dir=\"rtl\">לוּלַי</a>]); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָסִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:6\" href=\"/Exodus.26.6\">Ex 26:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:11\" href=\"/Exodus.26.11\">11</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:13\" href=\"/Exodus.36.13\">36:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:18\" href=\"/Exodus.36.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:33\" href=\"/Exodus.26.33\">26:33</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְסֵי זָהָב</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:6\" href=\"/Exodus.26.6\">6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:13\" href=\"/Exodus.36.13\">36:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ נְחשֶׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:11\" href=\"/Exodus.26.11\">26:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:18\" href=\"/Exodus.36.18\">36:18</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָסָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:11\" href=\"/Exodus.35.11\">35:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:33\" href=\"/Exodus.39.33\">39:33</a>.","next":"BDB, קַרְסֹל","prev":"BDB, קָרַס"}